        1349,
        440
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There shall be three Deputy Mayors. One of them shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Economic Policy and Development, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Operations, and one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Policy.",
