      "text": "(a) Advise and assist the Mayor on all policy, planning, and programs designed to foster the economic growth of the City, including commercial and industrial development, energy, foreign trade and investment, government regulation, motion pictures, rail freight, revenue enhancement and tax policy and programs.",
